      "body": "Up from ₹3,560, the current price target is an average from 19 analysts. New target price is 12% above last closing price of ₹3,429. Stock is up 32% over the past year. The company is forecast to post earnings per share of ₹58.90 for next year compared to ₹45.16 last year.",
