      "title": "Dividend increased to ₹9.00",
      "body": "Dividend of ₹9.00 is 125% higher than last year. Ex-date: 24th July 2026 Payment date: 6th September 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.3%, which is about the same as the industry average. Payout Ratios Payout ratio: 15%. Cash payout ratio: 11%.",
